  "description": "Drop-in ASP.NET Core 8 middleware + MVC filter that validates every file upload\n      (multipart form, AJAX FormData, raw binary, and base64-in-JSON) before it reaches\n      your controllers or disk: extension allow/deny list, MIME-type cross-check,\n      magic-number signature verification, polyglot / embedded-executable detection,\n      zip-bomb ratio guard, and configurable size limits. Configure entirely via\n      appsettings.json - no per-controller code required.",
  "id": "SecureFileUpload.AspNetCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-08T12:05:55.273Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "wZBGqLQeciCqOVsXXhvIKz1jRAioTX7WFRWbt8I3JuKOq55ZjvQ71RuynbvhQsQO5seUd6sZkGXaAHKkVHEDwQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 71770,
  "published": "2026-09-08T12:02:40.103Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Uses PDF object inspection to avoid script false positives in compressed\n      image streams while rejecting PDF JavaScript and launch actions.\n      Adds IFileValidator.CheckFile/CheckFileAsync for per-input file type and size\n      validation, richer validation result metadata, blocklist-first defaults, MIME\n      false-positive fixes, recursive archive inspection, image dimension limits,\n      a malware scanner hook, PNG/JPEG/GIF/BMP/WebP false-positive fixes, basic\n      PDF corruption detection, 255-character Gujarati/English filename support,\n      an Enabled switch, and packaged toast/client helper assets.",
